# CertifyROI Site - Environment Variables

## Local Development

Copy `.env.local` and fill in your Supabase keys:

```bash
cp .env.local .env.local.example
# Edit .env.local with your actual keys
```

## Vercel Deployment

Add these environment variables in your Vercel dashboard:

- `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`: `https://ejgadkswcjorkyzkqhfl.supabase.co`
- `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`: Your anon key from Supabase dashboard

## Getting Supabase Keys

1. Go to [Supabase Dashboard](https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/ejgadkswcjorkyzkqhfl/settings/api)
2. Copy the **anon public** key (not the service role key)
3. Use that key for `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`